@startuml
title Repository execution and delivery boundaries
rectangle "Original independent repositories (read-only to model)" as Original
rectangle "Existing worktree manager / repository leases" as Isolation
rectangle "Exact granted Codex worktree" as Worktree
rectangle "Independent AEO-4 validation" as QA
rectangle "AEO-5 delivery coordinator" as Delivery
rectangle "Exact approved publication grant" as Grant
cloud "GitHub branch / PR / CI / human reviews" as GitHub
Original --> Isolation : verify source/base and dirty preservation
Isolation --> Worktree : narrow authorized paths
Worktree --> QA : actual artifacts and child execution evidence
QA --> Delivery : current accepted evidence
Grant --> Delivery : action/scope/expiry checked
Delivery --> GitHub : writes disabled unless separately authorized
GitHub --> Delivery : observed current SHA and policy
note bottom of GitHub
No force push, protected writes,
merge or deployment capability
end note
@enduml
